  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Venlafaxine is an antidepressant (a serotonin–norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor) used for depression and anxiety-related conditions such as generalized anxiety disorder, social anxiety disorder, and panic-type anxiety disorders. It is an approved prescription medicine that is widely used, though it carries a boxed warning.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q898407&quot;>Wikidata Q898407</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>venlafaxine</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>N06AX16</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00285&quot;>DB00285</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/5656&quot;>5656</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:9943&quot;>9943</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q898407&quot;>Q898407</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C17H27NO2</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>277.408 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
